        </mxCell>
        
        <mxCell id="llm" value="OpenRouter LLM&#xa;Llama 3.1 70B Instruct (Free)&#xa;128K context window" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#e1d5e7;strokeColor=#9673a6;fontSize=12;fontStyle=1" vertex="1" parent="1">
          <mxGeometry x="500" y="980" width="400" height="70" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        
        <mxCell id="output" value="Generated Output (Grounded in Retrieved Context)&#xa;&#xa;Based on the evidence, several factors may prevent GIST:&#xa;1. SSRI antidepressants show correlation with lower incidence [Doc A, Doc E]&#xa;2. Research suggests off-target kinase inhibition mechanism [Doc B, Doc G]&#xa;3. Clinical trial CT-12345 shows promising results [Doc K]&#xa;&#xa;Novel Hypothesis: SSRIs may inhibit c-KIT pathway, explaining&#xa;the observed lower GIST rates in patients taking these medications.&#xa;&#xa;All claims cited with source references!" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#d4f1d4;strokeColor=#82b366;fontSize=11;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacingTop=15;spacingLeft=10;" vertex="1" parent="1">
